  "$id": "urn:spiritfoxos:manifest:native-source-v1",
  "title": "SpiritFoxOS native-source-v1 authoring profile",
  "description": "Opt-in source profile; not guest authorization or a frozen runtime ABI. Generated relocation metadata is not an author input. Strict JSON parsing and source budgets apply before schema validation.",
  "oneOf": [
    {
